        },
        {
          "text": "Mpawo ndakati, Akaka Mwami Jehova! Ncobeni nsikwe nindakalisofwaazya abuniini; kuzwa kubwanike bwangu akusikila sunu nsikwe nindakalya intundulu nanka nyama iyakalumwa munyama, alimwi taakwe cintu cisesemya niciba cimwi icakanjila mukanwa lyangu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.4.14"
            ]
          }
        },
