        },
        {
          "text": "Alimwi wakandaambila kuti, O mwana amuntu, ncobeni njoomanisya mu-Jerusalemu malilu oonse aabuumi. Bayoolya insima cakupimapima bulemu, acakukankama, aalo maanzi bayooanywa cakweelekaeleka acakuyoowa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
